<title>UK: UK Treasury forecasts core PPI flat in 1997.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury forecasts core PPI flat in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury forecast core producer prices unchanged in 1997 and rising 2.5 percent in 1998.  </p>
<p>In its 'red book', it forecast unchanged core PPI in 1997 compared with a 0.75 percent rise in 1996, and rising 2.5 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
